## Two Polygon panels side by side under one AreaLightSource over a Kd 0 matte
## surface: the left wound to light the camera, the right wound away from it.
## The intensity stays under 1 so 8-bit output never clips. AGENTS.md's desync
## convention: the block ends on a Sphere, here outside the frame, so a
## mis-parsed parameter list desyncs it. Not third-party.
Display "arealight_panel.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 64 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
AttributeBegin
Surface "matte" "Kd" [0]
AreaLightSource "arealight" 1 "intensity" [0.8] "lightcolor" [1 0.5 0.25]
Polygon "P" [-1.8 -0.8 0  -1.8 0.8 0  -0.2 0.8 0  -0.2 -0.8 0]
Polygon "P" [1.8 -0.8 0  1.8 0.8 0  0.2 0.8 0  0.2 -0.8 0]
AttributeEnd
Translate 20 0 0
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
